  "source": "Closed forms and small eigenproblems: a cantilever with a tip mass (T = 2 pi sqrt(m h^3 / 3EI)); a shear building (3 x 3, stories 12EI/h^3 held in rotation); a rigid diaphragm (3 x 3 in UX, UY, RZ, M from the joint masses about the master). Shapes at unit modal mass, the rest of each shape from statics (cantilever tip rotation 1.5 u / h); mass ratios over the free mass (rotations about the centre of all the mass).",
